{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 58,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Do ye indeed in silence speak righteousness?\nDo ye judge uprightly, O ye sons of men?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nay, in heart ye work wickedness;\nYe weigh out the violence of your hands in the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked are estranged from the womb:\nThey go astray as soon as they are born, speaking lies.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their poison is like the poison of a serpent:",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "They are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " like the deaf adder that stoppeth her ear,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Which hearkeneth not to the voice of charmers,\nCharming never so wisely.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Break their teeth, O God, in their mouth:\nBreak out the great teeth of the young lions, O Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them melt away as water that runneth apace:\nWhen he aimeth his arrows, let them be as though they were cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let them be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as a snail which melteth and passeth away,",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Like",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the untimely birth of a woman, that hath not seen the sun.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Before your pots can feel the thorns,He will take them away with a whirlwind, the green and the burning alike.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous shall rejoice when he seeth the vengeance:\nHe shall wash his feet in the blood of the wicked;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.58.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.58.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So that men shall say, Verily there is a reward for the righteous:\nVerily there is a God that judgeth in the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer for the punishment of the wicked.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician; set to Al-tashheth. A Psalm of David. Michtam.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
